  "releaseNotes": "Named-method invocation assertion: Then<TService>(nameof(TService.Method), Times) and .And<TService>(nameof(...), Times) verify how many times a named method was invoked, ignoring arguments — `.And<IEventQueue>(nameof(IEventQueue.MarkFailed), Never)` asserts it was never called with any args, without spelling out It.IsAny<>() per parameter. Matches any invocation of that name (aggregates across overloads); renders as \"IEventQueue.MarkFailed was not invoked\"",
